<title>UK: LIFFE COFFEE SLIPS THROUGH SUPPORT, COCOA WEAKER.</title>
<headline>LIFFE COFFEE SLIPS THROUGH SUPPORT, COCOA WEAKER.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Opens lower as expected, Sept slides below $1,500 as Sept/Nov stays at discount. Sept down $30 at $1,490 at 0933 GMT.</p>
<p>COCOA - Weaker across board but Sept stays above 1,010 stg support. Down 14 at 1,021 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Thin start. Oct up 30 cents at $322.60.</p>
</text>
